            "detailed_description": "<h1>Definitive Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/8f79ce5f8927f0f5a2a2ed506d6d78db.avif?t=1790268185\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras_big/8f79ce5f8927f0f5a2a2ed506d6d78db.avif?t=1790268185 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Definitive Edition inclui o jogo base, o Passe de Temporada e o Passe do Ano 2, além de 4 pacotes adicionais de conteúdo: Início Rápido, Deluxe, Nightfall Protocol e Cold Eye, mais o novo conteúdo de Last Rites.</p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Aproveite a experiência definitiva de jogo de tiro militar ambientada em um mundo aberto enorme, perigoso e reativo.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/a9970e03a1905f0b9bd9121b368d5348.avif?t=1790268185\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras_big/a9970e03a1905f0b9bd9121b368d5348.webp?t=1790268185 width=1560 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/5d6553a574f71890ee35370b1f7b40b7.poster.avif?t=1790268185\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/5d6553a574f71890ee35370b1f7b40b7.webm?t=1790268185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/5d6553a574f71890ee35370b1f7b40b7.mp4?t=1790268185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Volte a uma Bolívia mais sombria para caçar La Llorona em uma nova missão grátis. Aproveite a jogabilidade aprimorada com 60FPS, gráficos 4K, atualizações de usabilidade, novos itens estéticos e muito mais!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/2fcedc658f83718f9fa9883c83aee14c.avif?t=1790268185\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras_big/2fcedc658f83718f9fa9883c83aee14c.webp?t=1790268185 width=1560 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/6b527eb3418f46828cf64bb4a4f953dc.poster.avif?t=1790268185\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/6b527eb3418f46828cf64bb4a4f953dc.webm?t=1790268185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/6b527eb3418f46828cf64bb4a4f953dc.mp4?t=1790268185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Em um futuro próximo, a Bolívia cairá nas mãos de um impiedoso cartel de drogas. Lidere a sua equipe de soldados de elite e coordene invasões. Pilote drones e helicópteros e dirija os veículos mais insanos dentro e fora da estrada ao atravessar as paisagens impressionantes da Bolívia.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/7156524ee4c6f6d8c624ee4cd66dab0e.avif?t=1790268185\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras_big/7156524ee4c6f6d8c624ee4cd66dab0e.webp?t=1790268185 width=1560 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/ab0475b49eaa0ca88dc44f5c1963ef22.poster.avif?t=1790268185\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/ab0475b49eaa0ca88dc44f5c1963ef22.webm?t=1790268185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/ab0475b49eaa0ca88dc44f5c1963ef22.mp4?t=1790268185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Crie o seu Ghost do zero e personalize suas armas e equipamentos de uma seleção de milhares de combinações diferentes, incluindo estampas táticas, tatuagens para os braços, patches de mochila, capacetes e muito mais. Viaje por ar e mar com mais de 60 veículos diferentes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/4ab72dc549ab62cf066e80b378fb53cc.avif?t=1790268185\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras_big/4ab72dc549ab62cf066e80b378fb53cc.webp?t=1790268185 width=1560 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/3bd26c9fc122e03ee876280023f433e5.poster.avif?t=1790268185\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/3bd26c9fc122e03ee876280023f433e5.webm?t=1790268185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/3bd26c9fc122e03ee876280023f433e5.mp4?t=1790268185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Crie uma equipe com até 3 amigos. Você também pode jogar o modo PvP de combates táticos 4v4 com base em classes: Ghost War.",
            "about_the_game": "Aproveite a experiência definitiva de jogo de tiro militar ambientada em um mundo aberto enorme, perigoso e reativo.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/a9970e03a1905f0b9bd9121b368d5348.avif?t=1790268185\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras_big/a9970e03a1905f0b9bd9121b368d5348.webp?t=1790268185 width=1560 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/5d6553a574f71890ee35370b1f7b40b7.poster.avif?t=1790268185\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/5d6553a574f71890ee35370b1f7b40b7.webm?t=1790268185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/5d6553a574f71890ee35370b1f7b40b7.mp4?t=1790268185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Volte a uma Bolívia mais sombria para caçar La Llorona em uma nova missão grátis. Aproveite a jogabilidade aprimorada com 60FPS, gráficos 4K, atualizações de usabilidade, novos itens estéticos e muito mais!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/2fcedc658f83718f9fa9883c83aee14c.avif?t=1790268185\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras_big/2fcedc658f83718f9fa9883c83aee14c.webp?t=1790268185 width=1560 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/6b527eb3418f46828cf64bb4a4f953dc.poster.avif?t=1790268185\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"http