/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/4ab72dc549ab62cf066e80b378fb53cc.avif?t=1790268185\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras_big/4ab72dc549ab62cf066e80b378fb53cc.webp?t=1790268185 width=1560 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/3bd26c9fc122e03ee876280023f433e5.poster.avif?t=1790268185\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/3bd26c9fc122e03ee876280023f433e5.webm?t=1790268185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/3bd26c9fc122e03ee876280023f433e5.mp4?t=1790268185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Crie uma equipe com até 3 amigos. Você também pode jogar o modo PvP de combates táticos 4v4 com base em classes: Ghost War.",
